#: contents/ui/ConfigGeneral.qml
msgid ""
"The session token is the value the DeepSeek platform site keeps after you log in. It grants full access to your account — including creating and deleting API keys — so treat it like a password. Only token usage, cost history and the per-key breakdown need it; the API key alone is enough for the balance."
msgstr ""
"会话令牌是 DeepSeek 平台网站在你登录后保存的值。它可以完全访问你的账户——包括创建和删除 API 密钥——因此请像对待密码一样对待它。只有 Token 用量、费用历史和按密钥的明细需要它；仅查看余额只需要 API 密钥。"

#: contents/ui/ConfigGeneral.qml
msgid "How to get it:"
msgstr "如何获取："

#: contents/ui/ConfigGeneral.qml
msgid ""
"Log in at platform.deepseek.com, open Developer Tools (F12), then copy the value of the “userToken” entry under Application → Local Storage (in Firefox, Storage → Local Storage)."
msgstr ""
"登录 platform.deepseek.com，打开开发者工具（F12），然后在 Application → Local Storage（Firefox 中为 Storage → Local Storage）中复制“userToken”条目的值。"

#: contents/ui/ConfigGeneral.qml
msgctxt "opens the DeepSeek platform site in the browser so a token can be copied"
msgid "Open platform.deepseek.com"
msgstr "打开 platform.deepseek.com"

#: contents/ui/ConfigGeneral.qml
msgid "Session token:"
msgstr "会话令牌："

#: contents/ui/ConfigGeneral.qml
msgid "Stored in KWallet — enter a new token to replace it"
msgstr "已保存到 KWallet——输入新令牌以替换"

#: contents/ui/ConfigGeneral.qml
msgid "Paste the token from platform.deepseek.com"
msgstr "粘贴来自 platform.deepseek.com 的令牌"

#: contents/ui/ConfigGeneral.qml
msgid "Session status:"
msgstr "会话状态："

#: contents/ui/ConfigGeneral.qml
msgid "Kimi Code (optional)"
msgstr "Kimi Code（可选）"

#: contents/ui/ConfigGeneral.qml
msgid ""
"A Kimi Code (Coding Plan) key adds the weekly quota and per-model limits to the popup. Use a key that starts with sk-kimi- and the Kimi Code base URL — keys and addresses from the Kimi Open Platform (api.moonshot.cn) do not work here."
msgstr ""
"Kimi Code（Coding Plan）密钥可在弹窗中显示本周额度及各模型的限额。请使用以 sk-kimi- 开头的密钥和 Kimi Code 基础 URL——Kimi 开放平台（api.moonshot.cn）的密钥和地址在此不可用。"

